    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45014" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρῠ-μέδων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οντος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρυκρείων</span>
			, of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθήρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				135.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσειδάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					8.31
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόνον εὐ. Κρόνου</span>, i.e.
			Chiron, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>:—in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only as pr. n.; so also fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐρυμέδουσα</span></b> .</div>
